      "b_s01-m00": {
        "id": "b_s01-m00",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s01-m00",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788696600.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "In Disease B cells, transporter T2 shows up in the wrong compartment by imaging. I want to know whether that actually changes its function. Which functional readouts would complement the localization data?"
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s01-sys",
        "children": [
          "b_s01-m01"
        ]
      },
      "b_s01-m01": {
        "id": "b_s01-m01",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s01-m01",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788696660.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Localization and function can come apart, so pair the imaging with a measurement of what T2 does: uptake of a labelled substrate, surface labelling to quantify how much reaches the membrane, or a pulse-chase to follow delivery over time."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s01-m00",
        "children": [
          "b_s01-m02"
        ]
      },
      "b_s01-m02": {
        "id": "b_s01-m02",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s01-m02",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788696720.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I've been piloting a synchronized-release assay: hold T2 in the ER, release it all at once, and time its arrival at the surface. Early runs suggest slower arrival in Disease B cells, but it's only a pilot: few replicates and I haven't validated it."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s01-m01",
        "children": [
          "b_s01-m03"
        ]
      },
      "b_s01-m03": {
        "id": "b_s01-m03",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s01-m03",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788696780.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "That's a good fit for a trafficking question, because it measures movement over time. Treat the slower arrival as preliminary until it replicates across cell lines and conditions."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s01-m02",
        "children": [
          "b_s01-m04"
        ]
      },
      "b_s01-m04": {
        "id": "b_s01-m04",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s01-m04",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788696840.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "So my working plan is to compare localization with these functional readouts in the same cells, rather than relying on imaging alone."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s01-m03",
        "children": []
      }
    },
