        ]
      },
      "b_s02-m00": {
        "id": "b_s02-m00",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s02-m00",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788955800.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "For the synchronized-release pilot, how do I tell a real trafficking defect from an artifact of the assay itself? The tag on T2 might slow it down, for example."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s02-sys",
        "children": [
          "b_s02-m01"
        ]
      },
      "b_s02-m01": {
        "id": "b_s02-m01",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s02-m01",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788955860.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Use controls that each rule out one explanation: a condition that blocks the pathway completely, a cargo like receptor R1 that should be unaffected, an untagged or differently tagged T2, and matched expression levels so faster or slower arrival isn't just about how much protein there is."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s02-m00",
        "children": [
          "b_s02-m02"
        ]
      },
      "b_s02-m02": {
        "id": "b_s02-m02",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s02-m02",
          "author": {
            "role": "user",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788955920.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I've considered the blocked-pathway control and the unaffected cargo. I haven't tried a second tag yet, and I'm unsure how to match expression between Disease B and control cells."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": null,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s02-m01",
        "children": [
          "b_s02-m03"
        ]
      },
      "b_s02-m03": {
        "id": "b_s02-m03",
        "message": {
          "id": "b_s02-m03",
          "author": {
            "role": "assistant",
            "name": null,
            "metadata": {}
          },
          "create_time": 1788955980.0,
          "update_time": null,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Sorting cells into matched expression bins, or using an inducible promoter, are common ways to handle that. The assay still needs those controls before it can be called validated."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": true,
          "weight": 1.0,
          "metadata": {},
          "recipient": "all"
        },
        "parent": "b_s02-m02",
